"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2920,"###
 Muhammad bin Ma'mar narrated to us, saying: Muhammad bin Bakr narrated to us, saying: I was informed by Ibn Jurayj, who said: Al-Hasan bin Muslim informed me, saying: Mujahid informed me, saying: Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Layla informed me, saying: Ali bin Abi Talib (RA) informed me, saying: ""The Prophet (ﷺ) commanded me to stand over his sacrificial camels (Budn), and he commanded me to distribute all of them—the"
